4,"l":815,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["َأَحْ","V","stem","PERF|(IV)|3MS"]]},{"i":"72:28:11","a":"كُلَّ","t":"(of) all","p":"N","tr":"kulla","f":["M","ACC"],"r":16,"l":31},{"i":"72:28:12","a":"شَىْءٍ","t":"things","p":"N","tr":"shayin","f":["M","INDEF","GEN"],"r":10,"l":41},{"i":"72:28:13","a":"عَدَدًۢا","t":"(in) number","p":"N","tr":"ʿadadan","f":["M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":187,"l":1152},{"e":"٢٨","v":"72:28"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"72:14","t":"And among us are Muslims [in submission to Allāh], and among us are the unjust. And whoever has become Muslim - those have sought out the right course.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"72:15","t":"But as for the unjust, they will be, for Hell, firewood.'","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"72:16","t":"And [Allāh revealed] that if they had remained straight on the way, We would have given them abundant rain [i.e., provision].","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"72:17","t":"So We might test them therein. And whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord He will put into arduous punishment.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"72:18","t":"And [He revealed] that the masjids are for Allāh, so do not invoke with Allāh anyone.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"72:19","t":"And that when the Servant [i.e., Prophet] of Allāh stood up supplicating Him, they almost became about him a compacted mass.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"72:20","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"I only invoke my Lord and do not associate with Him anyone.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"72:21","t":"Say, \"Indeed, I do not possess for you [the power of] harm or right direction.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"72:22","t":"Say, \"Indeed, there will never protect me from Allāh anyone [if I should disobey], nor will I find in other than Him a refuge.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"72:23","t":"But [I have for you] only notification from Allāh, and His messages.\" And whoever disobeys Allāh and His Messenger - then indeed, for him is the fire of Hell; they will abide therein forever.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"72:24","t":"[The disbelievers continue] until, when they see that which they are promised, then they will know who is weaker in helpers and less in number.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"72:25","t":"Say, \"I do not know if what you are promised is near or if my Lord will grant for it a [long] period.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"72:26","t":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"72:27","t":"Except whom He has approved of messengers, and indeed, He sends before him [i.e., each messenger] and behind him observers","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"72:28","t":"That he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] may know that they have conveyed the messages of their Lord; and He has encompassed whatever is with them and has enumerated all things in number.","j":29,"h":58,"s":72,"a":28,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[72],"sajdah":false}